WEBVTT

00:00:05.552 --> 00:00:07.679
Did we get him? [sighs woozily]

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:10.891
Now!

00:00:13.018 --> 00:00:14.394
Sorry to barge in.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.523
You think you can come into my home,

00:00:17.606 --> 00:00:21.485
sit in my father's chair
and threaten my dragon?

00:00:22.069 --> 00:00:23.487
This is Berk.

00:00:23.779 --> 00:00:25.864
And we have defended our way of life

00:00:26.115 --> 00:00:27.658
from far worse than you.

00:00:27.741 --> 00:00:28.867
Ooh. [chuckles]

00:00:28.951 --> 00:00:31.787
A fighting spirit. I love it.

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:34.873
Only I'm afraid you're mistaken.

00:00:35.374 --> 00:00:38.168
You've never seen anything like me.

00:00:39.211 --> 00:00:40.337
[whistles]

00:00:41.547 --> 00:00:42.548
[gasps]

00:00:46.051 --> 00:00:47.553
[roars]

00:00:47.886 --> 00:00:49.179
Astrid, look out!

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:52.641
[roars]

00:00:52.724 --> 00:00:54.184
[Grimmel laughs]

00:00:55.018 --> 00:00:56.103
[whistles]

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:58.564
Look out! Son, get clear!

00:01:00.649 --> 00:01:01.733
Run!

00:01:01.817 --> 00:01:03.068
[Fishlegs groans weakly]

00:01:05.821 --> 00:01:07.072
[grunts]

00:01:09.658 --> 00:01:10.701
[coughing]

00:01:10.784 --> 00:01:14.121
Have my dragon ready when I return,

00:01:14.204 --> 00:01:17.291
or I will destroy everything you love.

00:01:20.711 --> 00:01:23.338
[both coughing]

00:01:24.173 --> 00:01:26.508
[people clamoring in distance]

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:30.804
[thunder rumbles]

00:01:30.888 --> 00:01:31.889
[man 1] Inside!

00:01:31.972 --> 00:01:34.099
-[man 2] It's the middle of the night!
-[man 3] What are we doing here?

00:01:34.183 --> 00:01:37.060
[Hiccup] All right. All right, everybody.
Settle down, please.

00:01:38.896 --> 00:01:40.314
-Fishlegs.
-[groans weakly]

00:01:40.397 --> 00:01:42.900
Have you ever seen
that species of dragon before?

00:01:43.775 --> 00:01:45.319
[high-pitched whimper]

00:01:45.861 --> 00:01:46.862
Let me at him!

00:01:46.945 --> 00:01:48.447
I'll give him a piece of my mind!

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:50.532
-And by mind, I mean fists!
-[grunts]

00:01:51.533 --> 00:01:54.286
Did you miss the part
where we almost died?

00:01:54.369 --> 00:01:56.497
-Have you seen my house?
-[crowd quiets down]

00:01:56.663 --> 00:01:59.291
This is a new kind of enemy.

00:01:59.374 --> 00:02:02.169
And I underestimated him.
Now, that's on me.

00:02:02.252 --> 00:02:03.754
But I will not do that again.

00:02:04.087 --> 00:02:07.299
[grunts] We're Vikings!
We don't run from a fight.

00:02:07.382 --> 00:02:09.551
At least, I don't. You might.

00:02:09.635 --> 00:02:11.094
I agree with Hiccup.

00:02:11.178 --> 00:02:13.013
We haven't seen the last of Grimmel.

00:02:13.096 --> 00:02:14.431
He's a predator.

00:02:14.515 --> 00:02:16.016
Single-minded and patient.

00:02:16.099 --> 00:02:18.101
He won't stop until he gets what he wants.

00:02:18.185 --> 00:02:19.811
-I'm with Eret.
-[chair scrapes]

00:02:19.895 --> 00:02:22.231
We have to take this threat seriously.

00:02:22.314 --> 00:02:24.274
Grimmel is just a sign of the times.

00:02:24.358 --> 00:02:27.611
Our enemies are getting smarter,
more determined.

00:02:27.694 --> 00:02:31.406
We're not just overcrowded.
We are exposed and vulnerable.

00:02:32.324 --> 00:02:36.870
Short of full-blown war
and risking everyone we love, I don't...

00:02:38.956 --> 00:02:42.376
I don't see a way
of staying here any longer.

00:02:42.459 --> 00:02:44.253
-[crowd grumbling]
-What would Stoick think of this?

00:02:44.336 --> 00:02:46.630
-Hey! Hear him out.
-[crowd quiets down]

00:02:52.719 --> 00:02:56.223
If we want to live in peace
with our dragons,

00:02:56.306 --> 00:02:58.058
we need a better plan.

00:02:58.141 --> 00:03:00.686
So what are you saying, Chief?

00:03:00.769 --> 00:03:02.896
I'm saying, we have to disappear.

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:04.231
Off the map.

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:08.110
Take the dragons to a place
where no one will find them.

00:03:08.193 --> 00:03:10.112
And where might that be?

00:03:10.195 --> 00:03:12.864
He's talking about a quest
for the Hidden World.

00:03:12.948 --> 00:03:13.949
The hidden what?

00:03:14.032 --> 00:03:15.909
-Out to lunch.
-[chuckles] Yeah.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:19.246
My father was obsessed with it
when I was a boy.

00:03:19.329 --> 00:03:24.126
He made notes and maps in search
of the ancestral home of all dragons,

00:03:24.668 --> 00:03:27.087
tucked away somewhere
beyond the edge of the world.

00:03:27.879 --> 00:03:29.840
It may be the solution we need.

00:03:30.841 --> 00:03:32.259
We are dragon people.

00:03:32.884 --> 00:03:34.761
-It's where we belong.
-[crowd grumbles]

00:03:34.928 --> 00:03:37.097
Look, I know this is our home.

00:03:39.016 --> 00:03:41.476
My father left me to protect it.

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:44.730
But Berk is more than this place.

00:03:45.314 --> 00:03:46.565
We are Berk.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:48.775
The people, the dragons.

00:03:48.859 --> 00:03:51.486
I say Berk is wherever we go.

00:03:54.656 --> 00:03:56.366
I'm with him! Who else?

00:04:07.586 --> 00:04:09.588
[bleating]

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:12.966
[low growl]

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.430
[Fishlegs] Excuse me. Coming through.

00:04:18.513 --> 00:04:20.223
Let me just get right through here.

00:04:20.307 --> 00:04:22.684
Fishmeat, look, eat your rocks.
Eat your rocks!

00:04:23.644 --> 00:04:26.563
Gods! People who fly
with babies are the worst.

00:04:26.647 --> 00:04:28.190
-[Fishmeat belches]
-[groans]

00:04:28.273 --> 00:04:31.318
I feel like I'm always
asking you this question, but...

00:04:31.401 --> 00:04:33.445
Whoa! Wake up, Grump. Wake up!

00:04:33.528 --> 00:04:35.614
Is there an actual plan or...

00:04:35.697 --> 00:04:38.784
Just keep flying
until we reach the end of the world.

00:04:38.867 --> 00:04:40.661
Ah. Seems sensible.

00:04:41.912 --> 00:04:44.122
[Chaghatai Khan] So, where are they?

00:04:44.206 --> 00:04:46.041
Gone. Obviously.

00:04:46.124 --> 00:04:48.210
The Night Fury escaped you?

00:04:48.293 --> 00:04:50.462
-Again?
-I encouraged it.

00:04:50.545 --> 00:04:53.715
They've abandoned
their only defensible position.

00:04:54.299 --> 00:04:57.094
Running scared
with what little they can carry.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:59.596
[groans] It just keeps going.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.473
That's 'cause the world is actually round.

00:05:02.599 --> 00:05:03.975
-[laughs]
-The sun's round. The moon's round.

00:05:04.059 --> 00:05:05.435
-Stars are round.
-[grunts]

00:05:05.519 --> 00:05:07.479
Even though they're small and stupid.

00:05:07.562 --> 00:05:08.689
[laughs]

00:05:08.772 --> 00:05:10.273
Right? Stars.

00:05:10.357 --> 00:05:12.442
Don't fret. They won't get far.

00:05:12.526 --> 00:05:14.861
The Night Fury is distracted.

00:05:15.737 --> 00:05:18.573
I introduced him to your female.

00:05:19.574 --> 00:05:21.368
-Furies mate for life, you see.
-[sniffs]

00:05:21.451 --> 00:05:22.494
[grunts]

00:05:22.577 --> 00:05:24.246
-What you picking up on, bud?
-[grunts inquisitively]

00:05:24.621 --> 00:05:26.248
[grunts happily]

00:05:26.498 --> 00:05:27.833
[gasps] The Light Fury!

00:05:27.916 --> 00:05:29.292
She's following us!

00:05:29.376 --> 00:05:30.502
[Hiccup] Cool!

00:05:31.336 --> 00:05:32.629
[squawks]

00:05:33.714 --> 00:05:34.923
-[Gobber] Would ya look at that?
-[Tuffnut] Where'd she go?

00:05:35.006 --> 00:05:36.383
Is she made of sky?

00:05:37.592 --> 00:05:39.553
[Hiccup] Whoa, hold up, Toothless.

00:05:44.516 --> 00:05:45.392
[growls softly]

00:05:46.435 --> 00:05:48.228
Well, look who it is.

00:05:48.562 --> 00:05:49.730
-[shrieking]
-Uh...

00:05:49.813 --> 00:05:51.022
[Hiccup screams]

00:05:51.231 --> 00:05:53.483
Oh, hey, it's really nice to finally...

00:05:53.567 --> 00:05:55.277
Ahh! [screaming]

00:05:56.403 --> 00:05:57.946
[purring]

